### React Optimizations

**Memoization:**
```typescript
// Expensive computations
const sorted = useMemo(() => sort(nodes), [nodes]);

// Callbacks
const handleClick = useCallback((id) => {}, []);

// Components
const Memo = React.memo(Component);
```

**Lazy Loading:**
```typescript
const Lightbox = lazy(() => import('./Lightbox'));

<Suspense fallback={<Spinner />}>
  <Lightbox />
</Suspense>
```

### Asset Optimizations

- SVG backgrounds (vector, scalable)
- Image lazy loading
- Fallback images
